      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my legs have been cramping like crazy lately and i've been feeling really wiped out all the time. i think my potassium might be low. i have stage 3 kidney disease so i usually have to be careful with stuff but would it be okay if i started taking these potassium supplements i found? they are 99mg each. i was thinking of taking one every few hours when the cramps hit. what do u think?",
