      "content": "okay i hear you but i'm just so uncomfortable right now. if i don't want to wait weeks for an appointment, is there anything else i can do to help the cramps? like is there a specific way i can eat or maybe a different type of supplement that's safer for people with CKD? i just really need some actual guidance on how to handle this so i don't have to suffer until my appointment.",
